<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>KayWallet – Identificación QR</title>
  <style>
    *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
    body {
      font-family: Inter, system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif;
      background-color: #f8f9ff;
      color: #0b1c30;
      min-height: 100vh;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
    }
    header {
      background-color: #000000;
      padding: 16px 32px;
    }
    header span {
      color: #ffffff;
      font-size: 16px;
      font-weight: 600;
      letter-spacing: 0.01em;
    }
    main {
      flex: 1;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      padding: 48px 24px;
    }
    .container {
      max-width: 520px;
      width: 100%;
      text-align: center;
    }
    h1 {
      font-size: 36px;
      font-weight: 700;
      line-height: 44px;
      letter-spacing: -0.02em;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
      color: #0b1c30;
    }
    .subtitle {
      font-size: 16px;
      color: #45464d;
      margin-bottom: 32px;
      line-height: 24px;
    }
    .qr-card {
      background: #ffffff;
      border: 1px solid #c6c6cd;
      border-radius: 8px;
      padding: 32px;
      box-shadow: 0px 4px 20px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.08);
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }
    .qr-wrapper {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: center;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
      padding: 16px;
      background: #fff;
    }
    .qr-wrapper svg {
      width: 180px;
      height: 180px;
    }
    .qr-placeholder {
      width: 180px;
      height: 180px;
      background: #d3e4fe;
      border-radius: 4px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      color: #45464d;
      font-size: 14px;
    }
    .steps {
      text-align: left;
      list-style: none;
      padding: 0;
    }
    .steps li {
      display: flex;
      align-items: flex-start;
      gap: 10px;
      font-size: 14px;
      line-height: 20px;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
      color: #0b1c30;
    }
    .steps li .dot {
      color: #0051d5;
      font-size: 20px;
      line-height: 18px;
      flex-shrink: 0;
    }
    .info-box {
      background: #eff4ff;
      border-radius: 6px;
      padding: 14px 16px;
      display: flex;
      gap: 12px;
      align-items: flex-start;
      margin-top: 20px;
      text-align: left;
    }
    .info-box-icon { color: #0051d5; flex-shrink: 0; margin-top: 2px; }
    .info-box-title { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; color: #0b1c30; margin-bottom: 4px; }
    .info-box-text  { font-size: 14px; color: #45464d; line-height: 20px; }
    .security-badge {
      margin-top: 20px;
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 6px;
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: #009668;
      letter-spacing: 0.02em;
    }
    .trust-bar {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 24px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      margin-top: 28px;
      padding-bottom: 8px;
    }
    .trust-item {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 6px;
      font-size: 11px;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: #45464d;
      letter-spacing: 0.06em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }
    footer {
      background: #000000;
      padding: 16px 32px;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 12px;
    }
    .footer-brand { color: #ffffff; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; }
    .footer-legal { color: #7c839b; font-size: 12px; }
    .footer-links { display: flex; gap: 20px; }
    .footer-links a { color: #7c839b; font-size: 12px; text-decoration: none; }
    .footer-links a:hover { color: #bec6e0; }

    /* Waiting indicator */
    .waiting-indicator {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 8px;
      margin-top: 16px;
      font-size: 13px;
      color: #45464d;
    }
    .spinner {
      width: 14px; height: 14px;
      border: 2px solid #c6c6cd;
      border-top-color: #0051d5;
      border-radius: 50%;
      animation: spin 0.8s linear infinite;
    }
    @keyframes spin { to { transform: rotate(360deg); } }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <span>KayWallet</span>
  </header>

  <main>
    <div class="container">
      <h1>Identifícate de<br>forma segura</h1>
      <p class="subtitle">Accede sin contraseñas, usando tu<br>dispositivo de confianza.</p>

      <div class="qr-card">
        <div class="qr-wrapper">
          {{#if qrCode}}
            {{{qrCode}}}
          {{else}}
            <div class="qr-placeholder">Generando QR…</div>
          {{/if}}
        </div>

        <ul class="steps">
          <li><span class="dot">•</span><span>Abre la aplicación <strong>KayWallet</strong> en tu teléfono móvil.</span></li>
          <li><span class="dot">•</span><span>Pulsa el botón <strong>"Escanear QR"</strong> en la pantalla de inicio.</span></li>
          <li><span class="dot">•</span><span>Apunta con la cámara hacia este código para entrar instantáneamente.</span></li>
          <li><span class="dot">•</span><span>Selecciona y comparte tu credencial verificable de identidad emitida por tu entidad de confianza.</span></li>
        </ul>

        <div class="info-box">
          <svg class="info-box-icon" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor">
            <path d="M12 2C6.48 2 2 6.48 2 12s4.48 10 10 10 10-4.48 10-10S17.52 2 12 2zm1 15h-2v-6h2v6zm0-8h-2V7h2v2z"/>
          </svg>
          <div>
            <p class="info-box-title">Identificación digital</p>
            <p class="info-box-text">Se te solicitará compartir una credencial verificable para completar tu identificación de forma segura.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="waiting-indicator" id="waiting-msg">
        <span class="spinner"></span>
        <span>Esperando identificación…</span>
      </div>

      <div class="security-badge">
        <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M12 1L3 5v6c0 5.55 3.84 10.74 9 12 5.16-1.26 9-6.45 9-12V5l-9-4z"/></svg>
        Conexión segura
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>

  <footer>
    <span class="footer-brand">KayWallet</span>
    <span class="footer-legal">© 2026 KayWallet.</span>
  </footer>

  <!-- Socket.IO client served by the backend -->
  <script src="/socket.io/socket.io.js"></script>
  <script>
    (function () {
      const SESSION_ID = '{{sessionId}}';

      const socket = io({ transports: ['websocket', 'polling'] });

      socket.on('connect', function () {
        console.log('[Socket.IO] Connected, sessionId:', SESSION_ID);
        socket.emit('join_session', SESSION_ID);
      });

      socket.on('vp_inserted', function (payload) {
        console.log('[Socket.IO] vp_inserted:', payload);
        if (payload && payload.vpHash) {
          window.location.href = '/identify/success?hash=' + encodeURIComponent(payload.vpHash);
        }
      });

      socket.on('disconnect', function () {
        console.log('[Socket.IO] Connection closed');
      });
    })();
  </script>
</body>
</html>
